，景帝時為平曲侯，坐法失侯。賀，武帝為太子時舍人。武帝立八歲，以太僕為輕車將軍，軍馬邑。後四歲，以輕車將軍出雲中。後五歲，以騎將軍從大將軍有功，封為南窌侯。後一歲，以左將軍再從大將軍出定襄，無功。後四歲，以坐酎金失侯。後八歲，以浮沮將軍出五原二千餘里，無功。後八歲，以太僕為丞相，封葛繹侯。賀七為將軍，出擊匈奴無大功，而再侯，為丞相。坐子敬聲與陽石公主姦，為巫蠱，族滅，無後。","source_term":"子敬聲"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji111-024","interpretation_note":"據本傳明示子敬聲配置父子來源路徑，分支字元不作排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-111","chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m028-0190"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p028"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji111-wei-huo"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji111-024","subject_person_id":"yay_w6f_lis_AA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"yay_w6f_lis_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p028","quote":"將軍公孫賀。賀，義渠人，其先胡種。賀父渾邪，景帝時為平曲侯，坐法失侯。賀，武帝為太子時舍人。武帝立八歲，以太僕為輕車將軍，軍馬邑。後四歲，以輕車將軍出雲中。後五歲，以騎將軍從大將軍有功，封為南窌侯。後一歲，以左將軍再從大將軍出定襄，無功。後四歲，以坐酎金失侯。後八歲，以浮沮將軍出五原二千餘里，無功。後八歲，以太僕為丞相，封葛繹侯。賀七為將軍，出擊匈奴無大功，而再侯，為丞相。坐子敬聲與陽石公主姦，為巫蠱，族滅，無後。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子敬聲","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"子敬聲承公孫賀本傳主語，未明生母與排行；私通不記婚姻。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"yay_w6f_lis_A","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p028","qu